@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@userId = 019ff881-7e3b-76c9-8d0e-d46ecb1b5fc9


### Criar usuário
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Raul Silva",
  "email": "raul@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json


### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/019ff375-cb8b-7759-955b-c6eaade68fde
Content-Type: application/json


### Atualizar usuário
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Raul Pontes",
  "email": "raul.pontes@example.com",
  "role": "admin"
}


### Alterar senha
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/change_password/019ff375-cb8b-7759-955b-c6eaade68fde
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "raul@example.com",
  "new_password": "novaSenha123",
  "new_password_confirmation": "novaSenha123"
}